extsem.c includes the public hsakmt/hsakmt.h, where HSAKMTAPI is empty.
With -fvisibility=hidden (set in libhsakmt/CMakeLists.txt), its two functions
become GLOBAL HIDDEN and the version script cannot export them, so
libhsa-runtime64.so.1 fails to link with undefined references to
hsaKmtImportExternalSemaphore / hsaKmtDestroyExternalSemaphore.

Include the internal libhsakmt.h instead, which redefines HSAKMTAPI to
__attribute__((visibility("default"))), matching every other source file.
--- a/src/extsem.c
+++ b/src/extsem.c
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
  * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
  */
 
-#include "hsakmt/hsakmt.h"
+#include "libhsakmt.h"
 
 HSAKMT_STATUS HSAKMTAPI hsaKmtImportExternalSemaphore(
     HSAuint32 NodeId, void *NtHandle,
